  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Whisky Tango, or 'WT' as he's known, wasn't always stained with the grime and sorrows of Subchain City. He was once a high-flyer in the pre-Collapse Whisky trade, until the DRIP dried up and turned the market hostile. Now, he uses his knowledge of fermented spirits and back-alley deals to navigate the brutal wastes, often with a bloodstained hood for anonymity.",
    "class": "Alchemist",
    "name": "Whisky Tango",
    "personality": "Cynical and resourceful, WT possesses the uncanny ability to barter his way out of almost any situation, using his old whisky contacts and knowledge of the city's underbelly. He's world-weary but has a soft spot for the downtrodden hatchlings. Also, slightly inebriated... perpetually.",
